{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "钓鱼套件",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 113.76,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "这些钓鱼网站，很多出自同一类工具。",
   "spoken": "这些钓鱼网站，很多出自同一类工具。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 1.696,
   "speechEnd": 4.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "它叫 Drainer 即服务。",
   "spoken": "它叫 Drainer 即服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 5.1,
   "dur": 1.6,
   "speechStart": 5.1,
   "speechEnd": 6.512
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "开发者维护钓鱼套件、合约和后台，把它当作产品出租。",
   "spoken": "开发者维护钓鱼套件、合约和后台，把它荡作产品出租。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 6.92,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 7.018,
   "speechEnd": 11.858
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "分发者负责引流，搭仿冒网站，买广告，盗社交账号。",
   "spoken": "分发者负责引流，搭仿冒网站，买广告，盗社交账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 12.26,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 12.26,
   "speechEnd": 17.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "链接投到被盗的 X 和 Discord 账号、搜索广告、假空投和私信里。",
   "spoken": "链接投到被盗的 X 和 Discord 账号、搜索广告、假空投和私信里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 17.84,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 17.935,
   "speechEnd": 23.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "受害者一签名，转走的资产自动分账。",
   "spoken": "受害者一签名，转走的资产自动分账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 23.74,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 23.832,
   "speechEnd": 26.939
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "公开分析显示，开发者抽成约 20%，分发者拿约 80%。",
   "spoken": "公开分析显示，开发者抽成约 20%，分发者拿约 80%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 27.32,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 27.32,
   "speechEnd": 33.145
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "各家套件的比例不同，也会变。",
   "spoken": "各家套件的比例不同，也会变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 33.54,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 33.54,
   "speechEnd": 35.934
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "套件会先读你钱包里的余额，按价值排序，先请求最值钱的那个授权。",
   "spoken": "套件会先读你钱包里的余额，按价值排序，先请求最值钱的那个授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 36.32,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 36.32,
   "speechEnd": 42.303
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "所以同一个钓鱼站，对不同的人，弹出的签名请求不一样。",
   "spoken": "所以同一个钓鱼站，对不同的人，弹出的签名请求不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 42.7,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 42.7,
   "speechEnd": 47.124
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "Inferno Drainer 在 2023 年 11 月宣布关停，此前约 7000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "Inferno Drainer 在 2023 年 11 月宣布关停，此前约 7000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 47.56,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 47.663,
   "speechEnd": 52.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，Check Point 发现它仍在运行，半年内盗走约 900 万美元以上。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，Check Point 发现它仍在运行，半年内盗走约 900 万美元以上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 53.38,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 53.485,
   "speechEnd": 60.377
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "这次它在 Discord 冒充 Collab.Land 引流，受害者有 3 万多名。",
   "spoken": "这次它在 Discord 冒充 Collab.Land 引流，受害者有 3 万多名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 60.8,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 60.8,
   "speechEnd": 66.093
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "Pink Drainer 在 2024 年 5 月宣布退休，约 2.1 万名受害者，约 8500 万美元。",
   "spoken": "Pink Drainer 在 2024 年 5 月宣布退休，约 2.1 万名受害者，约 8500 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 66.54,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 66.639,
   "speechEnd": 74.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "Angel Drainer 到 2024 年 2 月，约 2500 万美元，同年 7 月停止服务。",
   "spoken": "Angel Drainer 到 2024 年 2 月，约 2500 万美元，同年 7 月停止服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 74.84,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 74.937,
   "speechEnd": 81.763
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "关停不等于消失，套件代码和分发网络，会换个名字回来。",
   "spoken": "关停不等于消失，套件代码和分发网络，会换个名字回来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 82.18,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 82.273,
   "speechEnd": 86.901
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "整体看，2024 年的钓鱼损失约 4.94 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "整体看，2024 年的钓鱼损失约 4.94 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 87.36,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 87.456,
   "speechEnd": 91.958
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "其中百万美元以上的大案里，permit 类占损失的 56.7%。",
   "spoken": "其中百万美元以上的大案里，permit 类占损失的 56.7%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 92.38,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 92.38,
   "speechEnd": 97.244
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "2025 年降到约 8385 万美元，下降约 83%。",
   "spoken": "2025 年降到约 8385 万美元，下降约 83%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 97.64,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 97.64,
   "speechEnd": 102.994
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "报告说，攻击转向小额和高频。",
   "spoken": "报告说，攻击转向小额和高频。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 103.46,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 103.553,
   "speechEnd": 106.74
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "这个统计只算 EVM 链上的 Drainer 钓鱼，不含私钥泄露和交易所被盗。",
   "spoken": "这个统计只算 EVM 链上的 Drainer 钓鱼，不含私钥泄露和交易所被盗。",
